translit:
[Verse 1]
Thunbam unnaich soozhndhalaik kazhiththaalum
Inbam izhandhaen endrennich
Sorndhaalum
Ennippaar nee petra paeraaseervaadham;
Karththar seidha yaavum viyappaith tharum.

[Chorus]
Ennippaar nee petra paakyangal;
Karththar seidha nanmaigal yaavum
Aaseervaadham ennu ovvondraai;
Karththar seidha yaavum viyappaith tharum.

[Verse 2]
Kavalaich sumai nee sumakkum podhum;
Siluvai unakkup paluvaagum podhum,
Ennippaar nee petra paeraaseervaadham;
Karththar seidha yaavum viyappaith tharum.

[Chorus]
Ennippaar nee petra paakyangal;
